Note on bundled clinical content: the guideline PDFs in
test-cases/clinical-guidelines/ are NOT covered by this MIT license. Each
retains its original license as documented in
test-cases/clinical-guidelines/README.md:

  - USPSTF, CDC MMWR: US federal government, public domain
  - NICE NG133: Crown copyright, reusable for non-commercial decision support
  - WHO 2022 Antenatal Corticosteroids: CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO
  - IADPSG 2010 paper: CC open access via PubMed Central

The synthetic patient data in test-cases/patient-maria-santos-bundle.json and
test-cases/documents/maria-santos/ is entirely fabricated for demonstration
purposes and contains no real PHI.
